id: break-free
name: Break Free
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
adversaryActionCost: 1
# Opened while its Awakening applies (allow maneuver.<id>); a Special Maneuver, not a Villainous one - those every Adversary has.
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Break into a dangerous sprint, blowing away those foes that cling near to you.
text: >
  Break Free [1/Round]: Break into a dangerous sprint, blowing away those foes that cling near to you.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Effect: To use this Maneuver, you must spend an Adversary Action. Make a Clash (Impulsive vs Impulsive/Corporeal) against all Opponents within a Minor Sphere AoE. If you win, that Opponent is moved up to 1(T) squares in a straight line away from you. Then, you may use the Movement Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# An Adversary Action (adversaryActionCost); an Impulsive Clash at every Opponent in a Minor Sphere (theirs Impulsive or Corporeal -
# the Impulsive here); won, moved 1(T) Squares away - the table's. Then the Movement Maneuver out of sequence.
[on used]
areaClash(impulsiveVsCorporeal, minor);
maneuverOutOfSequence(movement);
